Add a health check URL for load balancers. An HTTP GET request to /healthz will
return HTTP code 200 even if the client is not authenticated.

The health check URL allows load balancers such as ALB and nginx to verify that
the server is running and healthy.

The '/healthz' URL is a widely adopted convention for load balancer health
checks.
